---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Where to Shop | Peaks and Puddles"
  description="Trusted UK and Nordic outdoor retailers, forest school stockists, and secondhand gear marketplaces for kids' technical waterproofs and winter layers."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-8">
    <article class="prose max-w-none">
      <h1>Where to Shop</h1>
      <p>
        Finding genuine technical kids' outdoor gear in the UK isn't always easy—high street "waterproofs" often soak through after twenty minutes on wet grass, while specialist Scandinavian brands can be tricky to track down. Below are the trusted UK retailers, Nordic stockists, and pre-loved marketplaces we actually use for forest nursery and winter mountain kit.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialist Kids' Outdoor &amp; Forest School Retailers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Little Adventure Shop:</strong> One of the best UK one-stop shops for Scandinavian and British forest school kit, stocking Didriksons, Reima, Muddy Puddles, and Spotty Otter.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Outdoor Kids:</strong> Great range of technical waterproof dungarees, insulated mittens, and thermal wellies with reliable UK shipping.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Scandi Mini / Scandinavian Outdoor Stockists:</strong> Ideal for tracking down genuine Nordic wool-blend base layers, balaclavas, and high-hydrostatic-head snowsuits.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Mainstream Outdoor &amp; Mountain Retailers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Decathlon UK:</strong> Unbeatable value for merino base layers, fleece mid-layers, and entry-level snow boots that hold up well to daily nursery wear.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cotswold Outdoor &amp; Tiso:</strong> Worth checking for end-of-season sales on technical kids' shells, hiking boots, and merino socks from brands like Patagonia, Columbia, and Smartwool.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Amazon UK:</strong> Useful for fast next-day delivery on everyday essentials like thermal socks, hand warmers, and backup waterproof mittens.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Secondhand &amp; Pre-Loved Gear</h2>
      <p>
        High-spec Nordic brands like Polarn O. Pyret, Reima, and Didriksons are built to survive multiple children. Before buying new, it is always worth checking:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Vinted &amp; eBay:</strong> Search by specific brand names and hydrostatic head ratings rather than generic "kids waterproofs" to find barely-worn forest school dungarees at half price.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Polarn O. Pyret Pre-Loved (PO.P Second Hand):</strong> Official resale platform for buying and trading in outgrown layers.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        <em>
          Transparency note: Some retailer links on this site are affiliate links. If you click through and buy something, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you.
        </em>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>